          "resource": "repo://internal/wrapper/wrapper.go#L1696-L1723",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4ba91ad60828246a54853c4e1c7ccdefd660e17ac327563d6e7d274d857c68d7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_26d9dea358b14215988836b672fed862",
      "statement": "A wrapped provider CLI process communicates with the Hub only through the wrapper's own WebSocket connection to /ws; many-ai-cli does not modify, proxy, or intercept the wrapped CLI's own network calls, config files, or credentials.",
